      "node: tests/bench/loader.bench.ts (pnpm exec tsx tests/bench/loader.bench.ts --runs 9) runs loadWorkspace against a fake fetch serving the committed public/data and placeholder geometry from memory: CPU cost only, no network or disk. performance.now() spans inside the loader; median, min and max of 9 runs in one process (the first run is JIT-cold, hence the max). hashMs is the wall time of an awaited WebCrypto digest while the other files are in flight, not main-thread time. retainedHeapMb: node --expose-gc --import tsx tests/bench/loader.bench.ts, heapUsed after gc with one workspace kept, minus before.",
